Cell["\<\
All twelve thirteen-propagator graphs have the same ordered internal topology \
and differ only by external-leg assignments. Contracting x3, x5 and x8 merges \
{2,7}, {3,8} and {6,10}. With attachment vertices a,b,c,d and core vertices \
e,f,g as labelled below, every one of the twelve contractions is the same \
unlabeled graph K4,3 with precisely the two edges a-f and d-e absent.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c65bf8a0-a7d6-47fe-b74f-9de6b28dcf99"],

