Cell["\<\
The contracted graph has E=10, V=7 and hence four loops. Vertices b and c are \
four-valent after their external legs are included, while g is internally \
four-valent. Its automorphisms exchange a<->d and b<->c independently. With \
p1,p2,p3,p4 fixed this gives the six pairs below; allowing crossing, all \
twelve graphs form one topology class.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"00e27744-7b08-41d5-bddf-d37f0ee7cae3"],

