Cell["\<\
The factorized expression makes the near miss transparent: a genuine \
cancellation generator and a valid F_SL obstruction decomposition exist. The \
hierarchy inequalities nevertheless close only at gap zero. The displayed \
oriented vector includes the final expansion-parameter entry explicitly: \
(rho;1)=(0,...,0;1). Since no strictly positive W_HR-W_SL is possible, this \
is not a hidden region.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7cb5f6d2-1296-4ef9-96aa-9b2c4d04fc36"],

