Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["5. Positive control: the three-loop Crown", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"90f6015d-ea93-4da7-889e-086bdc10d99a"],

Cell["\<\
The same presentation-independent algorithm must retain the known Crown \
hidden region. It finds exactly one positive pinch face. The witness has all \
xi=1 and a=b=1; the hierarchy LP gives rho_i=-1, W_SL=-4 and gap 1.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a75ce231-58d5-4c9c-8f1e-fad857f3d1da"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[GridBox[{
    {"\<\"F0 faces\"\>", "27"},
