Cell["\<\
A larger thirteen-propagator mixed-sign example, diagram 105232 with \
{x0,x1,x3,x5}=0, has 1,207 F0 faces. Every face is rejected algebraically and \
no nonlinear ambiguity remains.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"52c8c134-4647-4c5f-a3f3-ac28b102d927"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
